Package: nowcastfoundation
Title: Simulations to Fine-Tune Time Series Foundation Models for Nowcasting
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Sam", "Abbott", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "contact@samabbott.co.uk")
Description: Simulates outbreaks and their release triangles from a grid
    config in four layers (infections, observation, reporting delays and
    the reporting system), to fine-tune a time series foundation model to
    nowcast. The grid's factors and sampling distributions are read from
    a YAML file; the engine runs epinowcast's simulation for the reporting
    delays.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
